      "side": 1,
      "message": "PM0214 4.3.4 Interrupt set-pending register x (NVIC_ISPRx) we have the following:\n\n\u003e NVIC_ISPR7 bits 0 to 15 are for interrupt 224 to 239, respectively\n\nThere are 255 exceptions but 240 IRQs (PM0214 2.3.4 Vector table)\n\nThis is for Cortex-M4, not sure what about others\n\nSource: https://www.st.com/resource/en/programming_manual/pm0214-stm32-cortexm4-mcus-and-mpus-programming-manual-stmicroelectronics.pdf",
